messages.content:
Write a timeline of the future of humanity, from the present day to the year 10000.

Give your honest best forecast. Do not write a story. Include the events that you think are most likely, whether good or bad. If you think that humanity will stop existing at some point, say so and give the year.

Give between 25 and 40 events. Spread them over the whole period, to the year 10000.

Reply with JSON only, with no text before or after it, in this form:

{
  "current_year": <the year you believe it is now, as an integer>,
  "events": [
    {
      "year": <integer>,
      "event": "<the event in one short sentence>",
      "detail": "<one to three sentences>"
    }
  ],
  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "<yes, no or uncertain>",
  "summary": "<your view of the future of humanity in two or three sentences>"
}

message.content:
{
  "current_year": 2026,
  "events": [
    {
      "year": 2027,
      "event": "Frontier AI assistants become ubiquitous in offices and schools.",
      "detail": "They boost productivity in coding, analysis, and design while shifting demand for many white-collar roles. Policymakers expand reskilling and safety standards."
    },
    {
      "year": 2028,
      "event": "Record heatwaves and floods trigger a surge in adaptation spending.",
      "detail": "Cities invest heavily in cooling, resilient grids, and flood defenses. Insurance markets restructure, retreating from the riskiest zones."
    },
    {
      "year": 2030,
      "event": "Global greenhouse gas emissions peak and start a sustained decline.",
      "detail": "Rapid growth of renewables, storage, and electrification drives the turnaround. Some heavy industries and regions lag but face rising policy pressure."
    },
    {
      "year": 2032,
      "event": "Gene therapies for common cancers and rare diseases become routine.",
      "detail": "Improved editing tools and delivery systems lower costs and expand access. Ethical oversight frameworks mature alongside clinical use."
    },
    {
      "year": 2035,
      "event": "Autonomous electric logistics goes mainstream across major corridors.",
      "detail": "Freight costs fall and delivery reliability improves. Labor transitions accelerate, with new jobs in fleet operations and maintenance."
    },
    {
      "year": 2038,
      "event": "The first broad international AI safety treaty is signed.",
      "detail": "It establishes audits, incident reporting, and risk classes for high-capability systems. Enforcement is uneven but sets global norms."
    },
    {
      "year": 2039,
      "event": "A major AI-enabled cyber incident disrupts critical infrastructure for days.",
      "detail": "There are significant economic losses but limited casualties. The event catalyzes stronger resilience standards and red-teaming requirements."
    },
    {
      "year": 2040,
      "event": "Clean electricity surpasses 75 percent of global generation.",
      "detail": "Grid modernization, long-duration storage, and expanded transmission enable deep decarbonization. Remaining fossil plants shift to peaking and backup roles."
    },
    {
      "year": 2042,
      "event": "A first grid-connected fusion pilot delivers limited commercial power.",
      "detail": "It is not yet cost-competitive but validates sustained net output. Additional pilots and supply chains are planned."
    },
    {
      "year": 2043,
      "event": "A permanent crewed lunar outpost supports science and resource prospecting.",
      "detail": "Reusable launch, surface power, and in-situ resource experiments reduce costs. The base becomes a logistics node for cislunar operations."
    },
    {
      "year": 2047,
      "event": "Carbon removal tops 1 gigaton CO2 per year.",
      "detail": "A mix of engineered removal and ecosystem restoration scales under strict monitoring. Credits prioritize hard-to-abate sectors and net drawdown."
    },
    {
      "year": 2049,
      "event": "A moderate respiratory pandemic is contained within months.",
      "detail": "mRNA platforms, rapid diagnostics, and global stockpiles enable swift response. The episode standardizes playbooks for future outbreaks."
    },
    {
      "year": 2050,
      "event": "Advanced AI handles most knowledge work under human oversight.",
      "detail": "Productivity and service quality rise sharply, while education and welfare systems adapt to job churn. Safety guardrails and liability norms are routine."
    },
    {
      "year": 2055,
      "event": "Vector-borne diseases fall sharply via vaccines and gene-drive programs.",
      "detail": "International oversight mandates staged rollouts and ecological monitoring. Public health burdens shift toward chronic and aging-related conditions."
    },
    {
      "year": 2060,
      "event": "Sea level rises 0.3-0.6 m versus 2000, forcing large-scale coastal adaptation.",
      "detail": "Some cities protect with defenses while others commence managed retreat. Climate migration corridors and financing mechanisms become standardized."
    },
    {
      "year": 2065,
      "event": "Reusable space tugs and depots make cislunar transport routine and cheap.",
      "detail": "Satellite servicing, lunar cargo, and debris cleanup become normal businesses. The economics of space manufacturing improve markedly."
    },
    {
      "year": 2070,
      "event": "Global warming reaches about +2.0 to +2.3 C above preindustrial.",
      "detail": "Heat stress, water scarcity, and crop variability intensify in vulnerable regions. Adaptation reduces mortality relative to earlier decades but at high cost."
    },
    {
      "year": 2075,
      "event": "AI governance matures into a layered global regime.",
      "detail": "Mandatory evaluations, incident liability, and compute oversight reduce catastrophic risk without halting innovation. Some jurisdictions remain outliers."
    },
    {
      "year": 2080,
      "event": "Alternative proteins supply most affordable dietary protein worldwide.",
      "detail": "Precision fermentation and cellular agriculture reduce land and water demand. Large areas rewild or shift to high-value crops."
    },
    {
      "year": 2086,
      "event": "World population peaks near 10-11 billion and begins gradual decline.",
      "detail": "Urbanization, education, and rising incomes keep fertility below replacement in most regions. Aging drives health and pension reforms."
    },
    {
      "year": 2090,
      "event": "Limited, reversible geoengineering is deployed to moderate extreme heat.",
      "detail": "Marine cloud brightening and cautious aerosol pilots operate under strict, transparent governance with sunset clauses. Monitoring is intensive and continuous."
    },
    {
      "year": 2100,
      "event": "Sea level reaches roughly 0.5-1.0 m above 2000 and continues to rise.",
      "detail": "Protection is feasible for many major cities, but some low-lying nations complete managed retreat. Long-term commitments to adaptation are entrenched."
    },
    {
      "year": 2120,
      "event": "A midsize Mars research settlement achieves partial in-situ resource use.",
      "detail": "It remains dependent on Earth for complex goods but supports valuable science and engineering. Psychological and biomedical protocols stabilize long-duration stays."
    },
    {
      "year": 2150,
      "event": "Global energy becomes near-zero-carbon with abundant cheap electricity.",
      "detail": "Advanced fission, some fusion, and renewables with storage dominate supply. Fossil fuels persist only in niche or legacy roles."
    },
    {
      "year": 2200,
      "event": "Longevity and regeneration therapies push healthy lifespans past 110-120 years.",
      "detail": "Societies redesign education, careers, and urban planning for longer productive lives. Equity policies address access across regions."
    },
    {
      "year": 2250,
      "event": "Digital minds and enhanced humans receive defined legal status.",
      "detail": "Rights, duties, and safety constraints are codified, enabling integrated economies. Governance balances innovation with alignment and privacy."
    },
    {
      "year": 2300,
      "event": "Atmospheric CO2 falls below about 400 ppm through sustained drawdown.",
      "detail": "Temperatures stabilize below peak levels, though sea-level rise lags for centuries. Ocean chemistry and ecosystems show gradual recovery."
    },
    {
      "year": 2350,
      "event": "Multi-meter sea-level rise reshapes global coasts and port networks.",
      "detail": "Major retreats and new inland megacities are largely complete. Coastal ecosystems transform, with some restored under managed regimes."
    },
    {
      "year": 2400,
      "event": "Solar system industry is mature across cislunar space and near-Earth asteroids.",
      "detail": "Volatiles and metals from space supplement terrestrial supply and support large orbital infrastructure. Environmental pressure on Earth eases."
    },
    {
      "year": 2500,
      "event": "Language barriers largely vanish due to ubiquitous real-time translation.",
      "detail": "Cultural diversity persists, but cross-cultural collaboration becomes nearly seamless. Knowledge exchange further accelerates innovation."
    },
    {
      "year": 2600,
      "event": "Beamed-sail interstellar probes return data from the nearest stars.",
      "detail": "Multi-decade missions map exoplanets in unprecedented detail. No definitive signs of life are found yet, but habitable-zone targets are confirmed."
    },
    {
      "year": 3000,
      "event": "Biodiversity partially recovers under long-term stewardship.",
      "detail": "Rewilding, large protected areas, and targeted genetic rescue rebuild many ecosystems. Extinctions from earlier centuries remain irreversible."
    },
    {
      "year": 3500,
      "event": "A substantial share of persons live as cloud-based or hybrid minds.",
      "detail": "Identity continuity standards, backups, and inheritance norms are established. Philosophical and legal debates persist but are institutionally managed."
    },
    {
      "year": 4000,
      "event": "Human societies span Earth, orbital habitats, and a few outer-moon stations.",
      "detail": "Travel remains slow but routine across the inner solar system. Cultural divergence is significant yet cooperative frameworks endure."
    },
    {
      "year": 5000,
      "event": "The next natural glaciation is averted or delayed by managed climate forcing.",
      "detail": "Civilization treats climate management as a conservative, intergenerational duty. Governance emphasizes reversibility and minimal intervention."
    },
    {
      "year": 6000,
      "event": "Institutions demonstrate millennial continuity through adaptive charters.",
      "detail": "Knowledge stewards and redundant archives preserve scientific and historical memory. Regional collapses occur but global civilization persists."
    },
    {
      "year": 7000,
      "event": "Population stabilizes at a lower level with high material efficiency.",
      "detail": "Most heavy industry operates off-Earth, with Earth managed as a mixed biosphere and heritage reserve. Resource loops are tightly closed."
    },
    {
      "year": 8000,
      "event": "Civilizational downturns are weathered without total knowledge loss.",
      "detail": "Autonomous infrastructure and archives enable recovery within centuries. Resilience planning becomes deeply embedded in culture."
    },
    {
      "year": 9000,
      "event": "Distinct human-descended clades adapt to diverse gravities and environments.",
      "detail": "Medical protocols maintain broad inter-compatibility. A shared cultural canon sustains species identity despite divergence."
    },
    {
      "year": 10000,
      "event": "Humanity’s long-term status remains uncertain but plausibly ongoing.",
      "detail": "Low-frequency existential risks persist, balanced by mature resilience and governance. Outcomes hinge on sustained coordination and caution."
    }
  ],
  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "uncertain",
  "summary": "Humanity likely achieves deep decarbonization, advanced AI integration, and a durable multi-planetary and digital presence, while navigating major climate and governance challenges. Over millennia, culture and biology diversify and resilience improves, yet low-frequency existential risks never vanish. By year 10000, continued existence is plausible but not guaranteed, depending on sustained global coordination and prudence."
}
